inors, Bott periodicity, projective and\nLorentzian geometry, Jordan algebras, and the exceptional Lie groups. We also\ntouch upon their applications in quantum logic, special relativity and\nsupersymmetry.Comment: 56 pages LaTeX, 11 Postscript Figures, some small correction","documentType":"research","doi":"10.1090\/s0273-0979-01-00934-x","downloadUrl":"https:\/\/core.ac.uk\/download\/216013435.pdf","fieldOfStudy":null,"fullText":"Not available for public API users.","id":1064078,"identifiers":[{"identifier":"oai:citeseerx.psu:10.1.1.129.6738","type":"OAI_ID"},{"identifier":"oai:oai.dml.cz:10338.dmlcz\/141689","type":"OAI_ID"},{"identifier":"oai:oai.dml.cz:10338.dmlcz\/144052","type":"OAI_ID"},{"identifier":"216013435","type":"CORE_ID"},{"identifier":"oai:citeseerx.psu:10.1.1.732.567","type":"OAI_ID"},{"identifier":"33683679","type":"CORE_ID"},{"identifier":"2061033290","type":"MAG_ID"},{"identifier":"216026160","type":"CORE_ID"},{"identifier":"oai:oai.dml.cz:10338.dmlcz\/148260","type":"OAI_ID"},{"identifier":"12886201","type":"CORE_ID"},{"identifier":"216034371","type":"CORE_ID"},{"identifier":"33683607","type":"CORE_ID"},{"identifier":"20930145","type":"CORE_ID"},{"identifier":"oai:oai.dml.cz:10338.dmlcz\/141745","type":"OAI_ID"},{"identifier":"2563486","type":"CORE_ID"},{"identifier":"oai:oai.dml.cz:10338.dmlcz\/143813","type":"OAI_ID"},{"identifier":"oai:citeseerx.psu:10.1.1.418.9650","type":"OAI_ID"},{"identifier":"102490489","type":"CORE_ID"},{"identifier":"math\/0105155","type":"ARXIV_ID"},{"identifier":"23903529","type":"CORE_ID"},{"identifier":"216026047","type":"CORE_ID"},{"identifier":"oai:arxiv.org:math\/0105155","type":"OAI_ID"},{"identifier":"10.1090\/s0273-0979-01-00934-x","type":"DOI"},{"identifier":"oai:oai.dml.cz:10338.dmlcz\/140099","type":"OAI_ID"},{"identifier":"oai:citeseerx.psu:10.1.1.628.6516","type":"OAI_ID"},{"identifier":"216034900","type":"CORE_ID"},{"identifier":"103956891","type":"CORE_ID"},{"identifier":"345073071","type":"CORE_ID"}]